      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOCHINVAR COOGEE (3) was outclassed in a Breeders Challenge heat at Bathurst last start but he'll relish the class drop having led and dug deep to win at this circuit and distance prior. Draws to go forward so can bounce back. CAPTAIN TIDS (1) hasn't featured since he won his maiden at Penrith back in June but he has had a series of wide barriers. Much better served by the ace draw so could be a big improver. ONEDARKNIGHT NZ (9) draws on the back row again but came from there when he scored a win here two back. DARKNDUSTY (5) showed improvement for a 1.6m second behind Onedarknight last time. Fitter again third up and returns to the front row.",
